%%{init: {"fontFamily": "Inter"}}%%
flowchart LR
    O[User<br/>link, notes, photos,<br/>videos, pause button] <--> P(["Main agent<br/>one for the whole chat"])
    P --> R[Read and plan<br/>read the page, plan,<br/>fact and length checks]
    P --> M[Make<br/>presenter, music,<br/>pictures]
    P --> E[Change<br/>edit, add, remove, reorder scenes,<br/>swap versions, keep a try]
    P --> L[Look<br/>sees pictures and clips,<br/>answers in words]
    P --> S(["Scene agents<br/>one per scene, all at once:<br/>draws the starting pic,<br/>films the clip, fixes it"])
    S -. "result: passed or gave up" .-> P
    S --> C{Checks<br/>picture check,<br/>clip judge}
    C -- fail --> S
    P -- "once every scene is done" --> A[Assemble the ad<br/>clips, captions, overlays,<br/>music, end card]
